09:05.080 --> 09:10.560
So basically, I'm applying the total probability law with respect to the state variable xt.

09:10.560 --> 09:14.560
So this is just a total probability theorem.

09:14.560 --> 09:19.400
And then the derivation will be very similar to the derivation of the Kalman filter and

09:19.400 --> 09:22.660
the EKF filter.

